    <artifactId>homing-ui-docking</artifactId>
    <description>
        Docking: the protocol between the desk and the docks. A multi-tab pane
        is a dock; a chip pulled off its strip floats under the same hand; a
        floating pane dropped on a dock becomes a tab where the mark says.
        Docking owns the desk as a layer over the docks and reports every
        dock and undock as data through DockEvents. The workspace's seed.
    </description>

